          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Includes trips, plans, budgets, packing, wardrobe details and preferences. Photos and travel documents stay on this device and are not included. Export documents individually before signing out or deleting a trip. Backup files contain personal information; store them privately."
